    "description": "\n\n<div style=\"max-width: 800px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); border-radius: 8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n\n    <h1 style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: center; color: rgb(42, 93, 176);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Aeliya Marine Tech Pvt. Ltd\n    </h1>\n\n    <div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: center; font-size: 1.1em; color: rgb(255, 153, 0); margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n        Global Supplier of Rare, Obsolete &amp; Hard-to-Find Industrial Spares\n    </div>\n\n    <p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;\">\n        Top Rated Plus Seller | Worldwide Shipping | 30 Days Return\n    </p>\n\n    <hr style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; border-top: 2px solid rgb(221, 221, 221);\">\n\n    <!-- ITEM DESCRIPTION -->\n    <h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1.3em;\">\n        Item Description\n    </h2>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1.05em; line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5;\"><font size=\"4\"><strong>VOLCANO R4440V200-A Frame Detector Relay/Flame Monitor</strong></font></div><div style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5;\"><font size=\"4\"><strong>VOLCANO R4440V200-A</strong></font></div><div style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5;\"><font size=\"4\"><strong>VOLCANO CO., LTD</strong></font></div><div style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5;\"><font size=\"4\"><strong>N.Y.CO.,LTD.</strong></font></div><div style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5;\"><font size=\"4\"><strong>QUEEN PHENIX HYUNDAI 98</strong></font></div><div style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5;\"><font size=\"4\"><strong>FRAME DETECTOR RELAY</strong></font></div><div style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5;\"><font size=\"4\"><strong>FLAME MONITOR</strong></font></div><div style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5;\"><font size=\"4\"><strong>AFD MODEL</strong></font></div><div style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5;\"><font size=\"4\"><strong>AC200/220V 50-60HZ</strong></font></div><div style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5;\"><font size=\"4\"><strong>R4440V200-A</strong></font></div><div style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5;\"><font size=\"4\"><strong>D/C 1120NF</strong></font></div><div style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5;\"><font size=\"4\"><strong>*40V200 A 115026*</strong></font></div><div style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5;\"><font size=\"4\"><strong>14407753&nbsp; 0008-0</strong></font></div><div style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5;\"><font size=\"4\"><strong>MADE IN JAPAN</strong></font></div><div style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5;\"><font size=\"4\"><strong>WEIGHT: 350 GM</strong></font></div><div style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5;\"><font size=\"4\"><strong>REF NO: 116482</strong></font></div></div>\n    <!-- IMPORTANT NOTICE -->\n    <div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 10px 0px; padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 243, 205); border: 1px solid rgb(240, 195, 109); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\">\n        Buyer is responsible for any customs duties, VAT, or import charges.\n        Tracking details will be shared once the item is dispatched.\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- EXISTING ITEM DESCRIPTION -->\n    <div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1.05em; line-height: 1.5;\">\n        <!-- PASTE CURRENT ITEM DESCRIPTION HERE (AS-IS) -->\n        <!-- THIS CAN INCLUDE OCR TEXT FROM IMAGES -->\n    </div>\n\n    <hr style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; border-top: 2px solid rgb(221, 221, 221);\">\n\n    <!-- POSITIONING -->\n    <h3 style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(42, 93, 176);\">\n        About This Item\n    </h3>\n\n    <p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">\n        This item is part of our specialized inventory of\n        <strong>industrial, marine, automation, and control system spares</strong>\n        sourced from decommissioned plants, vessels, and legacy systems.\n    </p>\n\n    <p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">\n        Some items we list are <strong>obsolete, discontinued, or rarely available</strong>.\n        Quantities are usually limited to one unit, and restocking may not be possible.\n    </p>\n\n    <p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">\n        Our buyers typically include <strong>maintenance teams, procurement departments,\n        service engineers, and resellers</strong> supporting critical systems.\n    </p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span data-teams=\"true\"><strong>Trademark/Brand Disclaimer:</strong><br>\nAll product names, trademarks, brands, and logos mentioned in this listing are the property of their respective owners. They are used strictly for identification purposes only. We are an independent reseller of surplus and pre-owned industrial equipment and are not an authorized distributor, dealer, or affiliate of the manufacturer unless explicitly stated.</span></p>\n\n    <hr style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; border-top: 2px solid rgb(221, 221, 221);\">\n\n    <!-- CONDITION -->\n    <h3 style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(42, 93, 176);\">\n        Condition &amp; Important Notes\n    </h3>\n\n    <ul>\n        <li style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Item condition is based on available information.</li>\n        <li style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Items are sourced from surplus, ship recycling, or industrial decommissioning.</li><li><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Batteries or cells are not included unless explicitly stated in the item description, due to international shipping regulations.</font></li>\n        <li style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Manufacturer labels, packaging, or markings may vary.</li>\n        <li style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Please review all details carefully before purchase.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <hr style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; border-top: 2px solid rgb(221, 221, 221);\">\n\n    <!-- B2B SIGNAL -->\n    <h3 style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(42, 93, 176);\">\n        For Business &amp; Bulk Buyers\n    </h3>\n\n    <p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">\n        We support <strong>ongoing and urgent sourcing requirements</strong>\n        for hard-to-find and legacy spares.\n    </p>\n\n    <p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">\n        All communication and quotations are handled strictly through\n        eBay messages, in line with platform policies.\n    </p>\n\n    <hr style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; border-top: 2px solid rgb(221, 221, 221);\">\n\n    <!-- SHIPPING -->\n    <h3 style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(74, 74, 74);\">\n        Shipping Policy\n    </h3>\n\n    <p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">\n        Orders are dispatched within <strong>1 business day</strong>\n        (heavy items within 3 business days).\n        Worldwide shipping via DHL or FedEx on DAP basis.\n    </p>\n\n    <p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">\n        Buyer is responsible for customs duties, VAT, or import charges.\n        Tracking details are shared after dispatch.\n    </p>\n\n    <hr style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; border-top: 2px solid rgb(221, 221, 221);\">\n\n    <!-- RETURNS -->\n    <h3 style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(74, 74, 74);\">\n        Return Policy\n    </h3>\n\n    <ul style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">\n        <li>30-day return window from delivery date.</li>\n        <li>Item must be returned in original condition.</li>\n        <li>Refunds are processed after inspection.</li>\n        <li>Please contact us via eBay messages before opening a return.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <hr style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; border-top: 2px solid rgb(221, 221, 221);\">\n\n    <!-- ABOUT -->\n    <h3 style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(74, 74, 74);\">\n        About Us\n    </h3>\n\n    <p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">\n        Aeliya Marine Tech Pvt. Ltd has been supplying industrial and marine equipment\n        since 2015, serving customers worldwide with a focus on\n        <strong>rare availability, fast response, and reliable shipping</strong>.\n    </p>\n\n    <hr style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; border-top: 2px solid rgb(221, 221, 221);\">\n\n    <p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;\">\n        Thank you for choosing Aeliya Marine Tech Pvt. Ltd&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></div>",
